- **Eval compare mode** — `--baseline`/`--compare` in `hanihi-eval` to diff
  pass/fail + token usage between runs (stretch goal from plan 005).
- `add_ignore` tool / `--regenerate-ignore` — grow `.ignore` from within the
  agent.
